  "prefLabel": "Cla 301.01 Chair",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cla 301.01 “Chair” means the chair of the board of claims appointed pursuant to RSA 541-B:3, II, or a member of the board designated by the chair.\n\nSource. #8511, eff 12-09-05, EXPIRED: 12-9-13",
